    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. i guess i'm just worried about the maintenance schedule. if we go with stone, how often are we looking at deep cleaning or resealing to keep it from looking trashed? and is there a specific type of stone that's better at hiding those random scuff marks so the lobby doesn't look messy too quickly?",
